# The generated native projects are NOT versioned (owner arbitration
# 2026-08-24): `cap add` writes ~2000 files nobody can review, they conflict on
# every Capacitor upgrade, and `task deploy:prod` rsyncs the WORKING TREE — so a
# generated Xcode project would ship to the Raspberry Pi. `scripts/prepare.mjs`
# regenerates them and lays our own sources on top.
# Anchored to this package's root with a leading slash. Unanchored, `android/`
# also matches `native/android/` — the very sources that MUST be versioned —
# and they would have been excluded in silence.
/android/
/ios/
/node_modules/
